THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER APK FILE FOR THE "كيبورد عربي مزخرف" APPLICATION.

- This file is a placeholder (text file saved with .apk extension) so the download link works. It is NOT a real Android package.
- To replace with a real APK: upload the compiled keyboard.apk binary to the path assets/apk/keyboard.apk in this repository (via GitHub web upload, git push, or CI).
- After replacing, users who click "تحميل التطبيق" will download the real APK.

Instructions to replace locally:
1. Build your keyboard.apk using Android Studio or your build pipeline.
2. git add assets/apk/keyboard.apk
3. git commit -m "Add real keyboard.apk"
4. git push
